# LVT CRM — core context

Production: `https://lvt.vscgroup.io.vn`. Stack: React 19 + Vite (`src/`), Convex self-hosted (`convex/`), private file gateway `scripts/serve-production.mjs`.

## Read first (do not rediscover from scratch)

- Product + import rules: `README.md`
- Agent operating invariants: `CLAUDE.md`
- Existing Cursor git rule: `.cursor/rules/sync-git-after-changes.mdc`

## Project map

- Web UI: `src/` (`main.jsx` shell; `settings/`, `work/`, `boarding/`, `reports/`, `notifications/`, `homeroom/`)
- Backend: `convex/` — never hand-edit `convex/_generated/`
- Native: `ios-uikit-lvt/` only when scoped; preserve `ios-app/` and `android-app/` unless asked. Any Android/iOS UIKit change must bump the Profile version (see `.cursor/rules/native-app-version.mdc`)
- Tests: `npm test` → `tests/*.test.mjs`

## Roles

- `admin` — Thiết lập tối cao + account lifecycle
- `moderator` — operational manager; no supreme settings. With a `departmentId` it is scoped to that department in Công việc, Báo cáo, Đánh giá nhân sự, Ghi nhận lỗi (`convex/moderatorScope.ts`, error `MODERATOR_DEPARTMENT_SCOPE`); without one it stays school-wide
- `user` — menus from `permissionGroups.menuAccess`
- "Việc của tôi" (`personalTodos`) is owner-only and independent of `work` menu access/approval (see `CLAUDE.md`)
- Server auth is source of truth; UI visibility is not enforcement

## Working rules

- Stay inside this repo; start with `git status --short`; preserve unrelated dirty files
- Smallest coherent change; do not invent business rules — check README/CLAUDE/schema/tests
- After web/backend changes: `npm test`, `npm run build:production`, `git diff --check`
- Convex deploy/codegen only via repo wrapper scripts; never inline admin keys/secrets
